"Below, they call their offense right; above, he rewards their falseness. High and low deceive each other. It is hard to live among them.": "313314a20cc7",
"Chih-t'ui said: Of Duke Hsien's nine sons, only our lord is left.": "c589e7f507e5",
"He answered: To blame them and then copy them — the offense would be worse still. Besides, I have spoken words of resentment; I will not eat his food.": "8618eec54913",
"He answered: Words are the ornament of the body. If the body is going to be hidden, what use is ornament? That would be seeking to be seen.": "99c77f8578ab",
"Heaven had not cut off Chin; there had to be a master. Who but our lord was to preside over the sacrifices of Chin?": "b8e4197bbaf6",
"Heaven in truth set him there — and those several gentlemen take it for their own doing. Is that not a falsehood?": "7e7eea8de688",
"His mother said: But let him at least know of it. How would that be?": "b8c440cabd00",
"His mother said: Can you really do it? Then I will go into hiding with you.": "34de137c5382",
"His mother said: Why not ask for it too? If you die like this, who is there to blame?": "19a07314a2c6",
"Hui and Huai had no one close to them; within and without, all cast them off.": "d1a5c692cce8",
"So they hid, and there he died.": "072c3861d2fb",
